   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_377e435dbfa9232cf127",
   "sourceHash": "377e435dbfa9232cf127d9620fa18413548cb88fe0ff80feeecae2e8521af6e9",
   "text": "Vous ne savez pas quel programme s’applique ?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7831a70183b94a4ab633",
   "sourceHash": "7831a70183b94a4ab6338df7715122a280c7dedf2c77ac0884b1be9952961271",
   "text": "Vous ne savez pas quel programme s’applique à vous ou à votre proche ?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_31925806acaf16aae09b",
   "sourceHash": "31925806acaf16aae09bc63516aa045cd1f4902ff2526b8b6faeb731730d4f98",
   "text": "Nos médecins vous orienteront avec clarté et bienveillance.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_66fa43e9e55a7a3f8f35",
   "sourceHash": "66fa43e9e55a7a3f8f3544b20372873736ff240e9be6a7bd9ede06a43ca47b07",
   "text": "Aucune pression ici. Simplement une conversation — au rythme qui vous convient.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b6f3860173635bde5cc2",
   "sourceHash": "b6f3860173635bde5cc2b9374934c5bd9b9ed3068286b4e6d65ffe573dd6c348",
   "text": "Pas de remises. Pas d’urgence. Simplement des conseils honnêtes de la part de personnes qui se soucient de vous.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_44cb983134a850fb07be",
   "sourceHash": "44cb983134a850fb07be7f4eadd7a9dbade7f4438e7ecf7665f2b49907f9c246",
   "text": "Feuilles de plantes médicinales, curcuma, mortier et pilon en pierre, flacons d’huile et récipient en laiton suspendu",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
